OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry but cloudy start, turning
OL,6,Fwet and windy from late morning
OL,7,Fonwards, with some heavy and blustery
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain possible by the
OL,9,Fevening. The rain and cloud will clear
OL,10,Fbut remaining windy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear and dry to start, but
OL,13,Fstrong winds persist, reaching gale
OL,14,Fforce in places. Clear spells will be
OL,15,Fshort-lived as showers soon move in,
OL,16,Fsome will be heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
