OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FHeavy and blustery showers
OL,6,Fcontinue, with strong winds reaching
OL,7,Fgale force in places, some sunny
OL,8,Fspells in-between showers. Showers
OL,9,Fease somewhat by the evening, but
OL,10,Fwinds remain strong.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FStaying unsettled over the coming
OL,14,Fdays, with bands of rain followed by
OL,15,Fshowers and windy conditions at times.
OL,16,FSettling down later Wednesday as the
OL,17,Fwind eases and showers clear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
